  {
   "name": "marketing_segments",
   "description": "Marketing contact segments (SendGrid segments / CRM list views) with their filter definition and materialized contact count. Replaces the mis-seeded contactdb_segments, whose `name` column holds person names and whose `recipient_count` holds strings — it cannot back a real segment CRUD surface.",
